  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BAYDAR (Civil Society Synergy Floor)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt; of this Action is to elevate the role of CSOs within Jordanian society through needs-based upskilling and enabling resources to be better equipped to self-improve their structures and expand their services. More specifically, the action will strengthen capacities of CSOs through targeted needs-based upskilling and enabling resources for better autonomy and service provision (SO).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through targeted capacity building programs, 22 selected CSOs (2 hubs + 20 CSOs) with diversified capabilities in Jerash and Madaba will be able to translate those trainings into self-implemented, actual, sustainable services. This will be done through three outputs:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Output 1 enabled 2 selected CSOs - one in Madaba, one in Jerash - to become service &amp; knowledge hubs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Output 2 capacitated 20 CSOs in Madaba and Jerash, particularly those with practical thematic experience through upskilling programs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Output 3 realized community development plans according to sector of expertise through pairing&amp;amp; knowledge sharing, awareness-raising, and advocacy.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
